NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers the BUILD PIPELINE in this repository only — the code under
`src/`, `scripts/`, `tests/`, `docs/`, and the build configuration.

It does NOT cover dictionary CONTENT. Each grammar source's content remains
under its own licence, recorded per source in `LICENSING.md`. The published
release artifact contains content from two sources only, both CC BY 4.0:

  * 日本語文型データベース (NINJAL 国立国語研究所 研究系)
    CC BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
    DOI https://doi.org/10.15084/0002000610

  * Yokubi — The Common Grammar Guide (https://yoku.bi)
    CC BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Both are transformed for this dictionary: source prose is re-segmented into
Yomitan structured content. CC BY 4.0 requires that changes be indicated, and
that is the change.
